CARDLIKE MOD PATCH 1
# A Cardlike mod patch. Drop it in the Cardlike Mods window together with the base archive named below.
# "copy" and "picture" blocks take files from the base archive; "file" blocks are the mod's own files.
mod: all_in_jest
name: All in Jest
version: 0.7.2a
base: All in Jest 0.7.2a
base-file: All-In-Jest-0.7.2aa.zip

